# Day 42

**0km / 0 hours**

A rest day! I haven't had one in a long time and parts of my body as well as my mind could definitely use a day not on the road so it's overdue. That doesn't mean I was completely idle since there was logistics to work out for the upcoming days and also some shopping to do. The weather ahead is a bit concerning so hopefully that doesn't interfere too much with the plans. 

![The river, a nice piece of foreshadowing for what's ahead](./river avif)

My feet definitely need the rest from my walking boots although there was less time to relax and do nothing compared to what I expected. Still it makes me happier to continue the next day. Also I tried using the barbeque to cook stuff but it wasn't quite as nice as I was hoping.